OL,3,ASenior detective accused of using AI
OL,4,Afor decisions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior detective is being
OL,7,Finvestigated over alleged artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI)-related gross
OL,9,Fmisconduct.
OL,11,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,12,FConduct (IOPC) said it launched an
OL,13,Finvestigation into the officer in
OL,14,FAugust after they were referred to the
OL,15,Fwatchdog by Derbyshire Police following
OL,16,Fan "internal review" of their use of
OL,17,FAI.
OL,19,FDerbyshire Police said it made a
OL,20,Fvoluntary referral to the IOPC on 23
OL,21,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
