OL,3,ASenior detective accused of using AI
OL,4,Afor decisions
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, the IOPC said it was
OL,7,Falleged the officer used AI to "create
OL,8,Fpolicy decisions, assess and manage
OL,9,Frisk, justify decision-making, and
OL,10,Finput sensitive operational and
OL,11,Fpersonal case data".
